        "comments": "The assembly fCilMus1.hap1.1 is based on 17x Oxford Nanopore data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project (https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial Oxford Nanopore assembly generation with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial genome was assembled using MitoHiFi. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size. Order and orientation of scaffolds is unsure on SUPER_1 from\n17.96-18.61Mb, SUPER_2 from\n11.90-12.98Mb, SUPER_3 from\n3.87-4.16Mb, SUPER_6 from\n16.35-17.09Mb and SUPER_14 from\n3.41-6.16Mb.",
